# platform.rp2350_touch_lcd_154.sdcard

The RP2350 LCD 1.54 family's microSD socket, wired for four-bit SDIO and used here in SPI mode through
mm.sdcard: SPI0: clock GP18, MOSI GP19 (CMD), MISO GP20 (DAT0), chip select GP23 (DAT3), from
Waveshare's RP2350-Touch-LCD-1.54 schematic. rp2350_lcd_154 binds it and
rp2350_touch_lcd_154 inherits it. The panel is on SPI1. The card runs at 25 MHz once identified, which the Pico's
SPI divider rounds down to what it holds.
